  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『净小兽』车载空气净化器</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e954162e42514a53b0562fe85a596296.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-81a6e91f33904ef889398296fea28750-0-93d51af24e724ca50d91af62d2d0cb31f151de0b9eafbfa295cd319b2266777d\" alt=\"IMG_20260527_114835.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 430.00px;height: 593.22px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-1 车载空气净化器</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">净小兽车载空气净化器，如图1-1，通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”。用户通过车机大屏或车内语音助手，实现对车载空气净化器的开启、关闭等功能。同时支持各类场景自动化功能，例如“早上通勤”。</span></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/b91edaeb55164a34a376745c2e689065.png?auth_key=1795678278-ab27b9a04b0a4fd3aa804a9ce99f2035-0-114a021b82b5c34756003a745f0ab17a14da7b9d506199c6f03fd33bbddfbbfa\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a3df0de36f6f425c9d10083388315336.mp4?auth_key=1795678278-e8ad368adf784c49929e63ba859b88c2-0-9ebead61908fdb5c6c1f351f699afd9aa2401e0996947bfbd3f63c368c516f41\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">视频 1-1 车载空气净化器车机联动</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏支持的空气净化器功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">开启</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车载空气净化器</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">关闭</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车载空气净化器</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"> 电池低电量时显示：电池电量低于20%，请及时充电；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a568bc502fdc4e8380d6145f4273c57f.png?auth_key=1795678278-4edd73c407fb4406aa5dc43fe35df71f-0-9ae4eeafa1c9f41eee93138724024d8bba5c6bf5e2336914d1fd98c77b66b64e\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-2 智慧物联App-车载空气净化器设备详情</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 车机语音控制</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音控制车载空气净化器的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">打开车载空气净化器；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">关闭车载空气净化器；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/6e996c5c5d224be6a3bf7a0410ee04ea.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-950e9e16f8984dc3b95bee5fbc409beb-0-2e01497fd7686bcfbab40274d6169c6868344cd74f4525cb532d5dd81ca6cff2\" alt=\"IMG_20260527_114859.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 552.00px;height: 837.70px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 2-1 语音控制</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3. 场景自动化功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机端智慧物联App中，用户可以在“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">智慧物联APP-&gt;场景</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">”多个场景分类中，根据需要添加车载空气净化器的功能，如开启等离子净化功能。具体以如下场景模式为例：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">早上通勤；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/5e61421a615e4306bfe6e2958090142e.png?auth_key=1795678278-38ebeef9ce274d8c9f28e92571850c32-0-147b65449926c577360e5de5e17269f4ddaa3d30c2a987d451d491dd224c2b28\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 809.00px;height: 455.05px;\"></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 3-1 场景自动化--打开车载空气净化器</span></p>"
}
